# Branches, counted loops, while, until, repeat, switch, and a labeled break.
# Running returns 7.

When run, returning an integer
    the score is 0
    if 2 is greater than 1
        increase the score
    otherwise
        increase the score by 10
    if 1 is greater than 2
        increase the score by 10
    otherwise if 3 is greater than 2
        increase the score
    the total is 0
    for the i from 1 to 3
        increase the total by the i
    if the total is equal to 6
        increase the score
    the k is 3
    while the k is greater than 0
        decrease the k
    if the k is equal to 0
        increase the score
    the n is 0
    repeat
        increase the n
    until the n is equal to 2
    if the n is equal to 2
        increase the score
    switch on "b"
        when "a"
            increase the score by 10
        when "b" or "c"
            increase the score
        otherwise
            increase the score by 10
    the jumped is 0
    mark outer
    while the jumped is less than 10
        increase the jumped
        if the jumped is equal to 2
            continue
        if the jumped is equal to 4
            break to outer
    if the jumped is equal to 4
        increase the score
    return the score
